  "details": "it is my firm belief that any community or Group owner within VRChat should be 18 years or older due to having to deal with Situations Adults should only be involved in. I am making this suggestion to make it so that only 18+ verified users are able to create and able to have moderation roles.\n\n It is common knowledge that the platform is being overrun by a certain type of bad actor and those below 18 should not be allowed to be in a position to be exposed to those situations that comes with running a group or community.\n\n \n\nI believe this would be one step to help make Vrchat a better place and I am sure many will agree due to the responsibility of having to deal with situations a minor should never be exposed to.",
